---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE_NAME } from "../consts";
---

<BaseLayout
	title={`About — ${SITE_NAME}`}
	description="CultScribe: more than a notebook brand — a tribute to rebellion, expression, and originality. Read our story and brand voice."
	ogImage="/images/gallery/where-legends-forever-og.webp"
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
		<h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">The CultScribe story</h1>
		<p class="mt-8 text-2xl leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
			CultScribe was born from a love for iconic rock and metal bands whose music shaped generations. We believe
			that legends never die—they continue to inspire, create, and live within us. Our notebooks blend aesthetic
			design with musical history, inspiring students and creators to write boldly and think freely.
		</p>
		<div class="mt-16 space-y-8 text-lg leading-[1.85] text-ink-dim">
			<p>
				CultScribe is more than just a notebook brand—it is a tribute to the timeless spirit of rock and metal.
				Music from artists who shaped eras, broke boundaries, and inspired millions. We want the next generation
				to feel that same spark, that same passion, every time they open a notebook.
			</p>
			<p>
				In a world full of generic stationery, CultScribe delivers meaning. Every cover is a piece of cultural
				history. Every notebook is a reminder that creativity comes from rebellion, expression, and originality.
				Whether you are writing notes, lyrics, dreams, or sketches—CultScribe becomes a companion in your
				creative journey. Because legends never die. Their spirit lives on through every page you fill.
			</p>
		</div>
		<h2 class="mt-20 font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink">Brand voice</h2>
		<ul class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2" role="list">
			{["Bold", "Inspirational", "Cultural", "Artistic and expressive"].map((item) => (
				<li class="border-l-2 border-accent/50 pl-4 text-xl text-ink/95">{item}</li>
			))}
		</ul>
		<p class="mt-12 text-center">
			<a class="cult-link focus-ring text-lg" href="/gallery">Explore the gallery</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
